{"id":"3a7fb08fa07ece64","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-cnf.md","title":"Conjunctive Normal Form","display":"df-cnf — Conjunctive Normal Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-cnf","aliases":["57-df-cnf"],"display":"df-cnf — Conjunctive Normal Form","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-literal]]","[[57-df-prop-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-universal-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-cnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-cnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cnf — Conjunctive Normal Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" href=\"?note=4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" title=\"57-df-prop-satisfaction\">57-df-prop-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Conjunctive-Normal-Form\">Conjunctive Normal Form</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S\\)</span>，原子赋值及其延拓 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v^*\">\\(v^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" href=\"?note=4ab724e3f7d0fed3\" title=\"57-df-prop-satisfaction\">57-df-prop-satisfaction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a>。有限列的拼接记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\in\\vec s:P(a)\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a\\in\\vec s:P(a)\\rangle\\)</span> 保留原列次序和满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的各次出现。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or}\">\\(\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>，下式只对非空列使用它们。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 按列长递归删除重复项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 按无量词公式树递归列出首次出现的原子。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec p=A(\\varphi)\">\\(\\vec p=A(\\varphi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=|\\vec p|\\ge1\">\\(k=|\\vec p|\\ge1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,2^k-1\">\\(0,\\ldots,2^k-1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle E_r:r&lt;2^k\\land P(r)\\rangle\">\\(\\langle E_r:r&lt;2^k\\land P(r)\\rangle\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 递增排列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 保留函数调用接口；成员表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 是下式给出的范式类缩写，两种语法位置分别展开，不把一个范式类当作函数图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nU(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\nU(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown\\vec s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle\\frown U(\\langle b\\in\\vec s:b\\ne a\\rangle),\\\\\nA(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle P\\rangle\\quad(P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\nA(\\neg\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq A(\\psi),\\\\\nA(\\psi\\circ\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq U(A(\\psi)\\frown A(\\theta))\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nU(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\nU(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown\\vec s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle a\\rangle\\frown U(\\langle b\\in\\vec s:b\\ne a\\rangle),\\\\\nA(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle P\\rangle\\quad(P\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\nA(\\neg\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq A(\\psi),\\\\\nA(\\psi\\circ\\theta)&amp;\\coloneqq U(A(\\psi)\\frown A(\\theta))\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nb_{k,r}(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\lfloor r/2^{k-1-i}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2,\\\\\nv_{\\varphi,r}(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}b_{k,r}(i),&amp;P=p_i\\ (i&lt;k),\\\\0,&amp;P\\notin\\{p_i:i&lt;k\\},\\end{cases}\\\\\nC_{\\varphi,r}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle L_i:i&lt;k\\rangle),\\qquad\nL_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}p_i,&amp;b_{k,r}(i)=0,\\\\\\neg p_i,&amp;b_{k,r}(i)=1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\vec C_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C_{\\varphi,r}:r&lt;2^k\\land v_{\\varphi,r}^*(\\varphi)=0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CNF}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{And}(\\vec C_\\varphi),&amp;|\\vec C_\\varphi|&gt;0,\\\\p_0\\lor\\neg p_0,&amp;|\\vec C_\\varphi|=0.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nb_{k,r}(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\lfloor r/2^{k-1-i}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2,\\\\\nv_{\\varphi,r}(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}b_{k,r}(i),&amp;P=p_i\\ (i&lt;k),\\\\0,&amp;P\\notin\\{p_i:i&lt;k\\},\\end{cases}\\\\\nC_{\\varphi,r}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle L_i:i&lt;k\\rangle),\\qquad\nL_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}p_i,&amp;b_{k,r}(i)=0,\\\\\\neg p_i,&amp;b_{k,r}(i)=1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\vec C_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C_{\\varphi,r}:r&lt;2^k\\land v_{\\varphi,r}^*(\\varphi)=0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{CNF}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{And}(\\vec C_\\varphi),&amp;|\\vec C_\\varphi|&gt;0,\\\\p_0\\lor\\neg p_0,&amp;|\\vec C_\\varphi|=0.\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CNF}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\mathrm{Or}(\\vec L_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Or}(\\vec L_{m-1})\\rangle):\nm\\ge1\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (\\vec L_i\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\land|\\vec L_i|\\ge1)\\},\\\\\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_S.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CNF}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\mathrm{Or}(\\vec L_0),\\ldots,\\mathrm{Or}(\\vec L_{m-1})\\rangle):\nm\\ge1\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ (\\vec L_i\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\land|\\vec L_i|\\ge1)\\},\\\\\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\psi\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_S.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原等式中的 n、m_i、L_ij 未由输入确定，不能定义函数。现按原子首次出现次序和二进制真值表选择一个确定输出。恒真情形使用已有原子的析取，不增加常量构造子，也不引入量词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Conjunctive-Normal-Form","text":"Conjunctive Normal Form","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":